      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": [
        {
          "Label": "UNLABELLED",
          "content": "This was a study aimed to know the knowledge about asthma."
        },
        {
          "NlmCategory": "METHODS",
          "Label": "SUBJECTS AND METHOD",
          "content": "933 teachers of 27 schools from 7 cities (children aged between 4 and 15 years) using a self-administered questionnaire Half of them knew asthma prevalence and its hereditary nature. Nearly all related asthma with allergy, 38% with exercise, 25%had students who suffered from asthma attacks in the school, and 91% admitted to have limited information and wish to improve it."
        },
        {
          "NlmCategory": "CONCLUSIONS",
          "Label": "CONCLUSION",
          "content": "Our survey reveals that Spanish teachers have a limited information about asthma."
        }
      ]},
